---
<section class="pin centro" id="centro" data-scene data-pin="center" data-mode="ash" data-bg="#050304" data-glow="#1a0c0a" data-level="10" data-label="Centro de la Tierra">
  <div class="pin-stage">
    <svg class="centro-svg" viewBox="0 0 1600 900" preserveAspectRatio="xMidYMid slice" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs>
        <linearGradient id="ce-rock" x1="0" y1="0" x2="0" y2="1">
          <stop offset="0" stop-color="#0d0908" />
          <stop offset="0.5" stop-color="#1e1411" />
          <stop offset="1" stop-color="#0d0908" />
        </linearGradient>
      </defs>
      <g class="ce-world">
        <rect x="-400" y="-400" width="2400" height="1700" fill="url(#ce-rock)" />
        <!-- the ice crust Lucifer pierces -->
        <rect x="-400" y="430" width="2400" height="40" fill="#5a8bb0" opacity="0.5" />
        <!-- hips and hairy legs of Lucifer -->
        <g filter="url(#lu-fur)">
          <path d="M650 120H950C960 260 950 360 930 450H670C650 360 640 260 650 120Z" fill="#3a1a14" stroke="#ff7a2a" stroke-opacity=".4" />
          <path d="M680 440C660 560 640 700 660 860L740 880C760 720 770 580 790 460ZM920 440C940 560 960 700 940 860L860 880C840 720 830 580 810 460Z" fill="#3a1a14" stroke="#ff7a2a" stroke-opacity=".4" />
        </g>
        <!-- Dante & Virgil climbing -->
        <g class="ce-climb">
          <use href="#soul-arms" x="610" y="0" width="30" height="50" fill="#c9bfa8" />
          <use href="#soul-arms" x="590" y="40" width="28" height="46" fill="#e6d9c2" />
        </g>
        <text x="800" y="452" text-anchor="middle" font-family="Cinzel" font-size="16" letter-spacing="12" fill="#cfe8fa" opacity="0.8">CENTRO DE LA TIERRA</text>
      </g>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <div class="pin-caption">
    <p class="it">«'l punto<br />al qual si traggon d'ogne parte i pesi»</p>
    <p class="tr">Trepando por el pelaje de Lucifer, cruzan el punto hacia el que tienden todos los pesos. La gravedad se invierte: lo que era bajar, ahora es subir.</p>
    <cite>Inferno XXXIV, 110–111</cite>
  </div>
</section>
